    "title": "Road rage incident leads to rollover crash and arrest on North Market Street - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago\nSHREVEPORT, La. — A Shreveport woman was booked into the Shreveport City Jail on Tuesday following a road rage incident that ended in a multi-vehicle collision. Shreveport Police Department officers arrested Carmen Paul, 44, of Shreveport, after an investigation into a crash involving a Chevrolet Cruze and a pickup truck. The incident began on Interstate 220 and concluded near the 2100 block of North Market Street.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
